            "name": "Amazon Comprehend Import Model",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Creates a new custom model that replicates a source custom model that you import. The source model can be in your Amazon Web Services account or another one.</p> <p>If the source model is in another Amazon Web Services account, then it must have a resource-based policy that authorizes you to import it.</p> <p>The source model must be in the same Amazon Web Services Region that you're using when you import. You can't import a model that's in a different Region.</p>",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
